#X text 20 56 A biologically realistic neuron: membrane voltage v and recovery u \, a spike whenever v reaches +30 mV. Seven presets reproduce classic firing patterns. Spikes can be rhythms (rate 1000 = real time) or \, sped up \, pitched tones., f 150;
#X obj 10 100 cnv 1 640 450 empty empty TRY\ IT 8 12 0 13 #e3f0fb #1d3557 0;
